  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 06/02/2026, the continuous use of 54 Penbury Road, Southall, UB2 5RX as two self-contained flats was lawful within the meaning of Section 191(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\nThe evidence supplied is sufficient to establish that on the balance of probabilities the property at '54 Penbury Road, Southall, UB2 5RX' has been used as a two separate self-contained flats, notably as a ground floor flat and a first floor flat, for an uninterrupted period of at least four years from the date of application, and would therefore be lawful under Section 171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). "
